{"id":"433986","name":"海参水烘蛋","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/433986/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"海参","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"陈醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"柴鸡蛋4个，打入碗中。","img":"images/433986/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"打散。","img":"images/433986/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡发的海参2个。","img":"images/433986/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切薄片。","img":"images/433986/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中适量清水。","img":"images/433986/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋液和海参倒入，适量盐搅匀。开中小火。","img":"images/433986/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蛋液慢慢凝结，用勺子轻推锅底，将凝结成块状的鸡蛋推开，让新的蛋液凝结。","img":"images/433986/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"全部蛋液凝结。","img":"images/433986/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒入葱花。","img":"images/433986/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量生抽，陈醋，香油调味儿。","img":"images/433986/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"爱吃辣的倒入一点辣椒油，美味海参烘蛋即成。成品。","img":"images/433986/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/433986/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/433986/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}